      "title": "Four Palestinians and one Israeli killed during West Bank settler attack",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/jul/24/palestinians-israeli-killed-west-bank-shooting",
      "description": "<p>Several others seriously injured in attack that residents of Palestinian village say also involved Israeli military</p><p>Four Palestinians and one Israeli settler have been killed in a shooting in the northern West Bank, health officials have said, during what residents described as a settler attack also involving the Israeli military. Several more people were seriously injured.</p><p>The serious incident in the Palestinian village of Tell, near Nablus, is the deadliest attack in the West Bank this year and has the potential to lead to a series of reprisals between Israeli-backed settlers and Palestinian communities.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/jul/24/palestinians-israeli-killed-west-bank-shooting\">Continue reading...</a>",
